WEBVTT

00:18:28.636 --> 00:18:30.196
you can have your hymen rebuilt,

00:18:30.196 --> 00:18:32.636
you can have your pelvic floor resprung.

00:18:32.636 --> 00:18:36.756
Are we this uncomfortable
with the cunt actually as it is?

00:18:36.796 --> 00:18:39.796
It's a seat of enormous and awesome power.

00:18:39.836 --> 00:18:42.076
It can eat a penis and push out a baby,

00:18:42.116 --> 00:18:43.356
it's not a twinkle.

00:18:43.396 --> 00:18:45.196
(Laughter)

00:18:46.116 --> 00:18:48.316
It is an old word.

00:18:48.356 --> 00:18:49.516
